Labels and Selectors
====================
Labes are Key Value Pairs attached to object.
When one object in k8s needs to find another k8s object, we can use labels.

labels:
  <key>: <Value>

Selectors uses label key to find collection of objects matched with same value.

labels and selectors both are different.
Labels and Selectors are used in many places like POD, Services, Replicasets and Deployments etc.

Types of Selectors
==================
Equality Based Selectors.
Set based selectors.

Equality Based Selectors
selector:
  application: multicontainer
 
Set Based Selector
key in [Value_1, value_2 and value_3]
key notin [value_1]

