Liveness Probes and Readiness Probes
====================================
Liveness Probes and Readiness Probes are used to perform health check of applications.

Kubelet will perform Liveness Probes and Readiness Probes.

.war

Tomcat

Liveness Probe #to start the pods
==============
When Liveness probe fails, liveness probe restarts POD - Container.

Readiness Probe  #remove the end points the service suppose pod is not healthy
===============
When readiness probe fails, it will remove endpoint from service and users request will be routed to another POD.

Liveness Probes and Readiness Probes should be defined in container specification level.

Liveness Probes and Readiness Probes supports 3 types of probes,
exec.
tcpSocket.
httpGet - 99%

