StatefulSet
===========
Statefulset is a k8s object used to deploy and manage stateful applications.
StaetfulSet runs a group of PODs and maintains a sticky identify for each POD.
Statefulset is useful for managing applications that need persistent storage or stable unique network identify.
Statefulset manages deployment and scaling set of PODs and provides guarantees about the ordering and uniqueness of PODs.


