Node Affinity
=============
It is an advanced version of node selector.
Node affinity also works based on labels added to worker node.
It supports more logical operations to schedule PODs to worker node.

Soft Rule - PreferredDuringSchedulingIgnoreDuringExecution.
Hard Rule - RequiredDuringSchedulingIgnoreDuringExecution ==>> Node Selector.

Soft Rule - PreferredDuringSchedulingIgnoreDuringExecution
=========
PODs will be scheduled,
when labels are matched with any worker node.
Even when labels are not matched with any worker node.

