Ingress and Ingress Controller
==============================

Ingress Resource
================
It is responsible for storing routing rules.
Ingress Resource is to add rules to route traffic from External sources to applications running in K8s cluster.

Ingress exposes http 80 and https 443 routes from outside cluster to services within the cluster.

Ingress Controller
==================
It is an actual implementation that reads routing rules defined in ingress resource.
Ingress controller will make routing rules defined in ingress resources to work.

Ingress controller can be used to avoid creating load balancer for each micro service.


